  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Continuation of this thread: https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-unverified-tag-on-steamoculus-account-nameplate-hud-hide-four-digits\nPeople who make content frequently in VRChat are boggled to the core with friend requests. It seems a majority of requests that are received are from 'unverified' accounts consisting of those who have not yet created a VRChat account (and are still on Steam/Oculus with four digits), or those with Visitor rank.\nStreamer mode allows you to reject friend requests automatically, but disables it for those who have been on VRChat for a long time.\nPlease add a filter to whose friend requests you can see, perhaps filtering it to rank or unverified accounts?",
